detail.description:
Recheck every load-bearing theorem-use and exact calculation independently where feasible.

Required:

* source theorem hypotheses and notation mapping;
* projector orientation and normalization;
* exact cyclotomic/Jacobi identities;
* Galois orbit/rational descent;
* correspondence source/target dimensions and weights;
* nonzero target projection;
* cheapest adversarial counterprobe for every proposed promotion.

Preserve all failures and superseded claims. THEOREM_USE != INDEPENDENT_REPROOF; SOFTWARE_VERIFICATION != MATHEMATICAL_PROOF.
